From d0fe25387e58e68671a59797a3b6d571484bf6ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:12:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 1.21.69: performance and battery audit fixes

- Move the 5 s resume-position save to its own tiny DataStore so it no longer
  rewrites/re-decodes main preferences or invalidates global settings state.
- Idle the ViewModel and Stack tickers while paused; wake Stack immediately on
  play/seek. Slow VideoAmbientColors polling when no video surface exists.
- Read waveform progress in the draw phase; memoize non-active lyric lines.
- Compose the ambient backdrop only where it is displayed.
- Constant-time M3U content/clip lookups.

Source-only: not built or device-tested (see docs/PERFORMANCE_AUDIT_FIXES_2026-10-23.md).
